  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poverty Graduation Project - A Community Driven Intervention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to enable rural poor people &#x2013; especially women and youth &#x2013; to fulfil their development potential and attain a higher level of social and economic well-being. The project is aimed to uplift poor and vulnerable households out of extreme poverty on a sustainable basis. In the context of the devastating natural disaster that occurred in Pakistan, this project also helped poor households recover economically.</narrative>
  </description>
